%% What an OAN message status means (contract 3.0.0)
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> accepted: 202 / 200 replay
  accepted --> sending: worker picks it up
  accepted --> expired: deadline passed before sending
  sending --> sent: provider accepted it
  sending --> failed: provider definitely refused
  sending --> unknown: outcome uncertain
  sent --> delivered: 8028 receipt (SMS only)
  sent --> failed: 8028 receipt says failed
  delivered --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  expired --> [*]
  unknown --> [*]: never resent, never resubmit
  note right of sent
    Telegram stops here:
    sent is its best outcome
  end note
